<!--Gem_Page_Main_Editor--><div class="clearfix"></div><div class="gryffeditor"><div data-label="Row" data-key="row" data-atomgroup="row" id="r-1665548884399" class="gf_row" data-icon="gpicon-row" data-id="1665548884399" data-extraclass=""><div class="gf_column gf_col-lg-12 gf_col-md-12 gf_col-sm-12 gf_col-xs-12" id="c-1665548884330" data-id="1665548884330"><div data-label="Text Block" data-key="text-block" data-atomgroup="element" id="e-1699498368993" class="element-wrap" data-icon="gpicon-textblock" data-ver="1" data-id="1699498368993"><div class="elm text-edit gf-elm-left gf_gs-text-paragraph-1 gf-elm-center-lg gf-elm-center-md gf-elm-center-sm gf-elm-center-xs" data-gemlang="en" data-exc=""><p>2023.12.18</p></div></div><div data-label="Heading" data-key="heading" data-atomgroup="element" id="e-1665549000026" class="element-wrap" data-icon="gpicon-heading" data-ver="2" data-id="1665549000026"><div class="elm text-edit gf-elm-center gf-elm-center-sm gf-elm-center-xs gf-elm-center-md gf-elm-center-lg" data-gemlang="en" data-exc=""><h1 class="gf_gs-text-heading-2">【3日間連続特集】<br>KAPOK KNOTの<br>人と環境にやさしいものづくり</h1></div></div><div data-label="Heading" data-key="heading" data-atomgroup="element" id="e-1665742729415" class="element-wrap" data-icon="gpicon-heading" data-ver="2" data-id="1665742729415"><div class="elm text-edit gf-elm-center gf-elm-center-lg gf-elm-center-md gf-elm-center-sm gf-elm-center-xs" data-gemlang="en" data-exc=""><h1 class="gf_gs-text-heading-2">【3日間連続特集】<br>KAPOK KNOTの<br>人と環境にやさしいものづくり</h1></div></div><div data-label="Separator" data-key="separator" data-atomgroup="element" id="e-1701331746149" class="element-wrap" data-icon="gpicon-separator" data-ver="1.0" data-id="1701331746149"><div class="elm gf-elm-center gf-elm-center-lg gf-elm-center-md gf-elm-center-sm gf-elm-center-xs" data-align="left" data-exc=""><hr class="gf_separator"></div></div><div data-label="Text Block" data-key="text-block" data-atomgroup="element" id="e-1665548948246" class="element-wrap" data-icon="gpicon-textblock" data-ver="1" data-id="1665548948246"><div class="elm text-edit gf-elm-left gf_gs-text-paragraph-1 gf-elm-left-md gf-elm-center-lg gf-elm-center-sm gf-elm-center-xs" data-gemlang="en" data-exc=""><p><span style="color: inherit; font-family: inherit; font-size: inherit; text-align: inherit; letter-spacing: 1.2px;">こんばんは。<br>KAPOK KNOTライティング担当の神野です。</span></p><p><span style="color: inherit; font-family: inherit; font-size: inherit; text-align: inherit; letter-spacing: 1.2px;"><br></span></p><p><span style="color: inherit; font-family: inherit; font-size: inherit; text-align: inherit; letter-spacing: 1.2px;">KAPOK KNOTでは、</span><br></p><p>新素材「カポック」を使い</p><p>身も心もあたたまる商品を展開しています。</p><p><br></p><p><span style="color: inherit; font-family: inherit; font-size: inherit; text-align: inherit; letter-spacing: 1.2px;">ではこの「カポック」、</span></p><p><span style="color: inherit; font-family: inherit; font-size: inherit; letter-spacing: 1.2px; text-align: inherit;">果たしてどの国からきて、<br></span><span style="color: inherit; font-family: inherit; font-size: inherit; text-align: inherit; letter-spacing: 1.2px;">どんな人が生産しているのか。</span></p><p><br></p><p><span style="letter-spacing: 1.2px;">カポックを使ったアウターは</span></p><p><span style="letter-spacing: 1.2px;">従来の動物性ダウンと違って<br>一体どんな点が地球に優しいのか。</span><br></p><p><span style="letter-spacing: 1.2px;"><br></span></p><p><span style="color: inherit; font-family: inherit; font-size: inherit; text-align: inherit; letter-spacing: 1.2px;">地球環境にやさしい選択をするために<br>KAPOK KNOTに表示されている数字とは？</span><br></p><p><br></p><p><span style="color: inherit; font-family: inherit; font-size: inherit; text-align: inherit; letter-spacing: 1.2px;">今回はあまり普段考えることのない<br>自分に問いかけてみたくなる</span></p><p><span style="color: inherit; font-family: inherit; font-size: inherit; letter-spacing: 1.2px; text-align: inherit;">「3つのテーマ」をご用意し、</span></p><p><span style="color: inherit; font-family: inherit; font-size: inherit; letter-spacing: 1.2px; text-align: inherit;">KAPOK KNOTの</span><span style="color: inherit; font-family: inherit; font-size: inherit; text-align: inherit; letter-spacing: 1.2px;">ものづくりの裏側</span><span style="color: inherit; font-family: inherit; font-size: inherit; text-align: inherit; letter-spacing: 1.2px;">について<br>3日間連続でストーリーをお届けします。</span></p><p><br></p><p>きっとものづくりの裏側を知ることで</p><p>洋服に対して少しでも愛着を持てる自分が</p><p>待っているはずです。</p></div></div></div></div><!--gfsplit--><div data-label="Icon" data-key="icon" data-atomgroup="element" id="e-1701333725827" class="element-wrap" data-icon="gpicon-icon" data-ver="2" data-id="1701333725827" value=""><div class="elm gf-elm-center gf-elm-center-md gf-elm-center-sm gf-elm-center-xs gf-elm-center-lg" data-exc=""><div class="gf_icon-wrap"><svg fill="currentColor" height="100%" class="gf_icon" icon-class="bootstrap-outline-chevron-down" width="100%" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 16 16"><path fill-rule="evenodd" clip-rule="evenodd" d="M1.646 4.646a0.5 0.5 0 0 1 0.708 0L8 10.293l5.646 -5.647a0.5 0.5 0 0 1 0.708 0.708l-6 6a0.5 0.5 0 0 1 -0.708 0l-6 -6a0.5 0.5 0 0 1 0 -0.708z" fill="currentColor"></path></svg></div></div></div><!--gfsplit--><div data-label="Row" data-key="row" data-atomgroup="row" id="r-1701328700022" class="gf_row" data-icon="gpicon-row" data-id="1701328700022" data-extraclass=""><div class="gf_column gf_col-lg-12 gf_col-md-12 gf_col-sm-12 gf_col-xs-12" id="c-1665548884330" data-id="1665548884330"><div data-label="Row" data-key="row" data-atomgroup="row" id="r-1702889693474" class="gf_row" data-icon="gpicon-row" data-id="1702889693474"><div class="gf_column gf_col-lg-12 gf_col-md-12 gf_col-sm-12 gf_col-xs-12" id="c-1702889693538" data-id="1702889693538"><div data-label="Text Block" data-key="text-block" data-atomgroup="element" id="e-1702886592494" class="element-wrap" data-icon="gpicon-textblock" data-ver="1" data-id="1702886592494"><div class="elm text-edit gf-elm-left gf_gs-text-paragraph-1 gf-elm-center-lg gf-elm-center-md gf-elm-center-sm gf-elm-cen